<h2 class="mt-14">Consent and purchaser suppression for Bfcm</h2>
<p>For bfcm, audit consent capture and purchase-event suppression before the first flow goes live — every app must record bfcm opt-ins you can evidence and halt promos at checkout. Bfcm audiences forgive plain creative; they do not forgive promos sent mid-refund or right after checkout.</p>
