<p>Pricing changes frequently and varies by region, contact volume, and contract term, so check the official pricing pages of every shortlisted app and model an eighteen-month total that includes a peak season. Before banking on free for bfcm, check which free-tier limit — contacts, sends, branching, support — hits your bfcm plan earliest.</p>
